# Thought Reflection (Bot1's) and Notion Thief (Bot2's) both replace Bot1's draws outside its draw step: Bot1, the drawing
# player, chooses which applies first (CR 616.1; both cards' rulings). The draw step goes as in the scenario beside this
# one: Bot1 draws one card and Bot2 one. Then Bot1 casts Ancestral Recall and has Thought Reflection apply first to each
# draw: it becomes two draws, each of which only Notion Thief may still replace (CR 614.5) - and does, so Bot2 draws two
# cards for each of the three draws, six in all, and Bot1 none.

